[[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1314748539","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1893#issuecomment-1314748539","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1893","id":1314748539,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM5OXXh7","user":{"login":"acetcom","id":4222492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjI0OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4222492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom","html_url":"https://github.com/acetcom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-11-15T04:14:17Z","updated_at":"2022-11-15T04:14:17Z","body":"@lemon1009 \r\n\r\nI cannot find a problem in the log file. I don't know if system attempted to shut down open5gs or if the process was terminated because of a problem.\r\n\r\nIs this reproducible? If so, how about using gdb?\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ git clone https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs\r\n$ cd open5gs\r\n$ meson build --prefix=`pwd`/install\r\n$ cd build\r\n$ ninja install\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd then, run the process using GDB.\r\n```\r\n$ gdb ./src/amf/open5gs-amfd\r\n$ gdb ./src/smf/open5gs-smfd\r\n...\r\n```\r\n\r\nLet me know if you have any other information.\r\n\r\nThanks a lot!\r\nSukchan","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1314748539/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1314832391","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1893#issuecomment-1314832391","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1893","id":1314832391,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM5OXsAH","user":{"login":"lemon1009","id":109594749,"node_id":"U_kgDOBohIfQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109594749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemon1009","html_url":"https://github.com/lemon1009","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemon1009/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemon1009/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemon1009/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemon1009/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemon1009/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemon1009/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemon1009/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemon1009/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemon1009/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-11-15T06:25:09Z","updated_at":"2022-11-15T06:25:09Z","body":"@acetcom\r\nIt can be reproduced every 48 hours on version 2.4.10.\r\nIt is because I can't see the problem in the old version that I try to use the newer version. I will try to reproduce with GDB in version 2.5.5\r\nThanks","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1314832391/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1315185151","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1893#issuecomment-1315185151","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1893","id":1315185151,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM5OZCH_","user":{"login":"bmeglic","id":103102696,"node_id":"U_kgDOBiU46A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103102696?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmeglic","html_url":"https://github.com/bmeglic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmeglic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmeglic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmeglic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmeglic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmeglic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmeglic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmeglic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmeglic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bmeglic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-11-15T11:35:44Z","updated_at":"2022-11-15T11:35:44Z","body":"Hi,\r\n\r\nI am not sure if I encountered the same issue, but it does seem like it.\r\n\r\nI have left Open5GS core running over the weekend, and noticed that after approximately 2 days of running idle, some of the applications crashed with a coredump.\r\nI modified the code to shorten the timeouts for NF instance validity time and subscription validity, and can reproduce it quite easily.\r\n\r\n```\r\ndiff --git a/lib/app/ogs-context.c b/lib/app/ogs-context.c\r\nindex 1b22523f2..c5b373044 100644\r\n--- a/lib/app/ogs-context.c\r\n+++ b/lib/app/ogs-context.c\r\n@@ -187,10 +187,10 @@ static void app_context_prepare(void)\r\n     self.time.nf_instance.no_heartbeat_margin = 1;\r\n \r\n     /* 3600 seconds = 1 hour */\r\n-    self.time.nf_instance.validity_duration = 3600;\r\n+    self.time.nf_instance.validity_duration = 30;\r\n \r\n     /* 86400 seconds = 1 day */\r\n-    self.time.subscription.validity_duration = 86400;\r\n+    self.time.subscription.validity_duration = 45;\r\n \r\n     /*\r\n      * Message Wait Duration : 10 seconds (Default)\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd the gdb backtrace:\r\n\r\n```\r\n(gdb) bt\r\n#0  __pthread_kill_implementation (no_tid=0, signo=6, threadid=140021553890880) at ./nptl/pthread_kill.c:44\r\n#1  __pthread_kill_internal (signo=6, threadid=140021553890880) at ./nptl/pthread_kill.c:78\r\n#2  __GI___pthread_kill (threadid=140021553890880, signo=signo@entry=6) at ./nptl/pthread_kill.c:89\r\n#3  0x00007f5952e25476 in __GI_raise (sig=sig@entry=6) at ../sysdeps/posix/raise.c:26\r\n#4  0x00007f5952e0b7f3 in __GI_abort () at ./stdlib/abort.c:79\r\n#5  0x00007f595300e3b1 in ?? () from /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libtalloc.so.2\r\n#6  0x00007f59538b5745 in ogs_talloc_free (ptr=0x55a0b39082d0, location=0x7f59534b5b51 \"../lib/sbi/context.c:1821\") at ../lib/core/ogs-memory.c:107\r\n#7  0x00007f595349de71 in ogs_sbi_subscription_data_remove (subscription_data=0x7f595010a010) at ../lib/sbi/context.c:1821\r\n#8  0x000055a0b246058f in amf_state_operational (s=0x7f594efafbb0, e=0x7f59480246e0) at ../src/amf/amf-sm.c:586\r\n#9  0x00007f59538c7cf0 in ogs_fsm_dispatch (fsm=0x7f594efafbb0, event=0x7f59480246e0) at ../lib/core/ogs-fsm.c:127\r\n#10 0x000055a0b2439098 in amf_main (data=0x0) at ../src/amf/init.c:150\r\n#11 0x00007f59538b89eb in thread_worker (arg=0x55a0b39050e0) at ../lib/core/ogs-thread.c:67\r\n#12 0x00007f5952e77b43 in start_thread (arg=<optimized out>) at ./nptl/pthread_create.c:442\r\n#13 0x00007f5952f08bb4 in clone () at ../sysdeps/unix/sysv/linux/x86_64/clone.S:100\r\n(gdb)\r\n```\r\n\r\nCrash happens when subscription timeout expires for the 2nd time. On first subscription timeout, a call to\r\n `ogs_sbi_subscription_data_remove(subscription_data);` frees up memory, which is then used and double-free'd on 2nd timeout.\r\n\r\n[amf_crash.txt](https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/files/10012226/amf_crash.txt)\r\n\r\nRegards\r\nBostjan","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1315185151/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/1315199416","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1893#issuecomment-1315199416","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/1893","id":1315199416,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM5OZFm4","user":{"login":"acetcom","id":4222492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjI0OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4222492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom","html_url":"https://github.com/acetcom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-11-15T11:49:42Z","updated_at":"2022-11-15T11:49:42Z","body":"@bmeglicit \r\n\r\nYou're right. That is a BUG in open5gs. I'll get back to you when I fix this.\r\n\r\n@lemon1009 : you don't have to test anymore.\r\n\r\nThank you so much!\r\nSukchan\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","p